  "description": "STAF.LLMEval is a .NET library and AI testing framework for evaluating LLM and GenAI responses in unit tests and CI/CD. Score AI outputs with exact match, keyword overlap, TF-IDF semantic similarity, LLM-as-judge, and RAG groundedness / hallucination detection. Includes fluent Eval API, assertions (ShouldPass, ShouldBeGrounded), Options/DI, JSON/JSONL evaluation suites, and HTML/JSON reports. Works with OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Google Gemini, and Ollama. Ideal for ChatGPT/GPT evaluation, RAG quality checks, golden-dataset regression, and automated AI response validation on .NET 8/9/10.",
