  "releaseNotes": "STAF.LLMEval 2.0.1 — Metadata and discoverability update (same APIs as 2.0.0)\n\n- Richer NuGet title, description, and search tags (LLM evaluation, RAG, hallucination, AI testing, etc.)\n- Expanded PackageReleaseNotes and README wording for NuGet / Google / AI search discovery\n- No breaking API changes from 2.0.0\n\n2.0.0 Adoption features (included):\n- Multi-target net8.0/net9.0/net10.0; Eval.Direct/Judge/Grounding; assertions; AddLLMEval; JSON/JSONL suites + HTML/JSON reports; Azure OpenAI\n- Classic EvaluationRequest / EvaluateAsync remain compatible\nSee https://github.com/sooraj171/LLMEval/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
